WEBVTT

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:38.650
Summer.

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:40.870
Summer!

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.310
So hot...

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:57.980
Well, it's summer.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:04.650
I bought a popsicle!

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.890
Wait, this kind doesn't have instant prizes.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.010
You can have it.

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:10.650
Eh? Why?

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.240
It'd be a waste!

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.250
I'm buying another one!

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:16.950
Isn't it more of a waste to buy another?

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.840
If I win, I get a free one!

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.640
Eh? It won't come out...

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:30.540
I didn't see it.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:33.010
I didn't see if I won or not.

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.020
There was nothing written on it.

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:38.770
Why do you crush my dreams?!

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.980
Now it's no fun...

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:45.030
I won...

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.550
H-How??

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:48.830
I thought that kind didn't have any prizes!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.100
Looks like they just started recently.

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:53.860
I'm buying another one!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.300
Hey, wait.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.730
Sonya-chan, are you...

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:02.450
Go turn this in for me while you're at it.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:04.310
Damn it!

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.480
Damn it! Damn it!

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.260
I bought a bunch!

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.690
You bought way too many...

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.570
I have to win at least once!

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.770
Won't you get sick of them?

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:28.010
No worries! I bought a bunch of different ones!

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:30.170
Do all of those have prizes?

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.790
Idiot.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:37.450
Damn it! Damn it!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:43.140
I've never tried that flavor. Give me a bite.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:44.850
Sure...

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:47.400
Yes! That one's a loser!

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:52.070
Eat the rest!

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:55.140
Geez....

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.950
That one was expensive! Eat this instead!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.400
That's a prize type. You sure?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:07.110
And...

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:08.960
I won.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:19.120
I'm full at this point so I was going to give that one to you...

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:22.120
I'm sorry!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.720
What have I done?!

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.300
I'll win and give it back to you!

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:31.540
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.710
What are you doing?

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.140
Agiri-san...

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:38.260
Is this some kind of punishment game?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:43.770
Wow, that's a lot of ice cream.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.680
I'm trying to win a free one.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.680
Ah, that one's a winner.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:54.190
I had one last time and it was delicious.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.530
Oh, that kind of "winner"...

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.660
Can you tell which one has a prize with ninja techniques?

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.150
Well...

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:06.490
It doesn't work very often, but I'll give it a try.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.160
First I eat one.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.290
Ah, sorry.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.330
It didn't work.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.680
You just tried your luck!?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.600
Can't you figure it out before eating it?

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.580
Well I can tell you if any particular one is a winner or not.

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.840
This one's a loser.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:36.100
So cruel...

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:41.860
If you want, I can use a ninja technique that turns a loser into a winner with just one—

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.970
Don't write on it!!

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.790
That's enough, you can just have the rest.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:48.100
I'll happily take them off your hands.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:52.670
Oh, that last one's a winner.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.700
Woah, it really is!!

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.510
I got my free one!

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:03.620
So good!

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.670
You're going to make yourself sick, eating so many.

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:11.940
I never get sick of cold things!

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:13.790
So your stomach's an idiot too.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.510
What? It's good, you know?

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:32.630
Raaaaaawr!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:35.640
Another day.

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:40.570
It's so hot...

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.840
Sonya-chan, aren't you hot?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.570
I am, but there's no point whining about it.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.790
This is just the thing for the heat!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.750
Don't play along with her!

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.040
Okay, enough with the fans.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:14.780
Let's think up a more refreshing way to cool down.

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:16.920
Like wind chimes!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.800
Eh? They're not moving...

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.410
Because there's no wind.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.650
Refreshing! Refreshing!

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.190
And now you're back to fanning.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:43.770
Let's raise up a green curtain to make this scenery more refreshing!

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.090
What the heck?

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:47.530
We can plant bitter melon vines or morning glories to block the sunlight!

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:49.660
And it's good for the environment, so two birds with one stone!

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:52.460
It's weird to hear you make a sensible suggestion...

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.610
With that said, I brought one!

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:56.300
Bitter melon!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.400
Patiently.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:02.400
Summer's going to end.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:13.060
Summer's obviously hot.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:15.730
There's no need to go out of the way to try make it cooler.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.770
You're the one who was complaining it's hot.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:23.310
We should be doing summer-like activities instead like watermelon breaking.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.160
In fact, it's our duty to do that!

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:29.440
The sea is calling...

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.760
Even so, we didn't have to go out of our way to come here.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.180
Let's get right to the watermelon breaking!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.520
I'll start off!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.080
After all, whoever's guiding always gets hit on the head!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.350
Alright!

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:51.630
Let's go!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.980
Hey. Why are you facing this way?

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.540
Alright, tell me where!

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.460
Uh, right.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.450
Back a little.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.630
Left.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:03.400
Up.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.220
Do it properly!

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:09.370
If you can tell I'm joking, just don't do it.

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:11.210
Next, Sonya-chan!

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.330
Whatever.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.890
I'll do it in one shot.

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:15.410
Left!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.120
I can't trust Yasuna.

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:17.830
Right!

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:19.800
I'll go based on my memory.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.040
There!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.920
What the heck are you doing?!

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.410
I want to break it too!

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:30.900
So what do you want me to do?

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:33.340
We'll both try to do it!

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.630
Whoever breaks it first wins!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:39.170
Uh, isn't this kind of dangerous?

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.090
What am I doing?

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:50.080
This is dumb.

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.680
Gotcha!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.380
Geez!

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:08.050
That's unfair! How come you're eating?!

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:09.690
I broke it.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:14.020
I broke it before you.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:19.880
I see... you got to it before me.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:20.970
Too bad.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.370
It's gotten dark.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:35.130
Yeah.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.940
I'm hungry.

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:38.360
Yeah.

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:41.590
Oh right, I brought snacks!

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:43.120
I think I put them somewhere here...

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:43.840
Ah, here!

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:47.090
But it's actually a test of courage!

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.360
Summer's all about the test of courage—

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:50.930
She fainted?

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:53.280
Get it together, Sonya-chan!

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:59.120
Stay away!

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:02.480
Wow, fireworks!

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.100
One day.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.840
Mornin'!

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.380
Good morning!

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.550
I'm fine, thanks!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.440
What's wrong, Sonya-chan?

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.170
It's nothing.

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:44.610
But you should stay away from me today.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:47.400
Oh come on, that again?

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:51.550
You're trying to put on a tsundere character?

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:53.490
Don't attribute weird motives to me!

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:06.350
Someone's been after me lately.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.350
Who?

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:10.780
Someone from a different organization.

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:12.930
Well, it's a part of being an assassin.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:17.970
B-But with an innocent bystander like me nearby, you'll be fine right? Right?

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:18.940
I guess.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.700
I can just use you as a shield I suppose.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.220
So mean!

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.130
And then I'll bargain my life with your enemy and double-cross you!

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:29.140
How about I take care of you before that happens then?

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.610
I'm joking!

00:12:32.110 --> 00:12:34.880
I said I'm just joking!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.120
No, that wasn't—

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.160
I didn't think they'd come for me in the classroom!

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.040
Wait for me!

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:45.100
I'll be killed!

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.760
Why you...

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:55.470
I saved you!

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:59.730
Let's lure them over there!

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.560
Save me!

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:03.600
I'm an innocent bystander!

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.990
Give it up! That's pointless now!

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:14.300
There!

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:19.690
What's wrong?

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.100
An assassin's chasing us!

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.420
That's no good.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:26.720
I'll help you out then.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.230
We're friends, after all.

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:32.380
And today I brought shuriken with me!

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:34.550
"Today"?!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.770
Caught you, scum!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:47.720
I accidentally threw my brand new cell phone...

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:52.340
You there! Show yourself!

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:04.120
It would seem there's no point hiding anymore!

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.390
Eh?

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:09.190
Next one over?

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:12.720
This... stupid...

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:22.980
Got a little confused there, but I won't let you escape!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.390
So you're the assassin?

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.350
In the flesh!

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:28.940
I came here to erase y—

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:31.250
Ah! You ninjas never have any manners and just attack!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:32.790
Too easy!

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.910
Fine, I'll start with y—

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:42.990
I can throw things other than shuriken.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.380
Before exams.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.890
Exams are coming up...

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:56.280
Oh yeah!

00:14:56.280 --> 00:15:00.120
How about I give you a head massage that'll make you smarter?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.600
I'm fine.

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:03.690
Oh come on.

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:06.270
I said I'm fine!

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:09.050
Actually, that feels kind of good.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.640
You look so dumb!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.630
How about I reinvent your face then?

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.240
I'm sorry! Please don't!

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:22.490
I'll go next.

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:25.500
Oh you really needn't bother...

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.130
Ow ow ow ow ow!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:30.110
Stop! I'll become dumber!

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.200
Like you can be any dumber!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.660
No, maybe this'll have a reverse effect!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:37.010
No way...

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:43.580
I'll teach you something good, so lay off me.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:48.100
It's some yoga that I learned from TV!

00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:50.020
That crap again?

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:54.250
There's all sorts of good effects if you do it properly!

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:58.840
This pose makes you smarter!

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.130
You look dumb.

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:01.790
Now you try, Sonya-chan!

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:04.160
Hell no, that's embarrassing!

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:07.790
It's fine! There's others that make you stronger too!

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:09.510
You do this...

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:11.170
Then this...

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:13.110
Well?

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:14.440
You look like an idiot.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.050
Just joking!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.820
This will make those punches you're so fond of stronger!

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:23.850
Does this really work?

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:25.310
Definitely!

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.260
I just came up with it on the spot, after all!

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:35.190
See? Your punch got stronger!

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:38.050
This pose is for calming anger.

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:42.570
My lunch today will help me get smarter too!

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:46.050
I told my mom to replace the usual seaweed with fish.

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:47.290
Why fish?

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:49.950
Well, they always say how fish boosts your intelligence, right?

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:51.960
Time to eat up.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:55.970
It's just fish-shaped seaweed lunch...

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.010
What's that?

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:00.550
A fish-fried sandwich.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.300
You're eating fish too?!

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:05.000
It's just a coincidence.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.390
This sucks...

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:09.890
I'm gonna go buy something with fish in it!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.880
They only had taiyaki...

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.920
So why did you buy it?

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.660
Yet another day.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.380
"I came to kill you."

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.290
"Meet me in the empty classroom."

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.660
Must be another one of Yasuna's pranks.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.870
The next day.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.450
"You'll regret it if you don't come."

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:48.330
Again, the next day.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:51.310
I'm begging you. Please come.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:55.000
Enough with this!

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:57.640
What're you talking about?

00:17:57.640 --> 00:17:59.370
Ah, I'm going to the bathroom.

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.020
It wasn't her?

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:11.640
"I'm aiming a gun at you right now."

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.490
"If you don't want me to shoot, do a weird dance."

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:19.170
So that note in my shoe locker was you?!

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:22.170
I don't know anything about your shoe box!

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.690
Was there something there?

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:28.180
Lunchtime.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.600
I might as well check.

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:40.300
You little...

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.070
So this was all your doing after all!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.520
Let go!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:47.950
In order to get rid of you, I needed to disguise myself and get you to come here.

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:49.780
I'm the fake Yasuna!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:51.990
W-Wait!

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.500
I'm the real one! I'm the real one!

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:00.420
So can you prove you're the fake?

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.100
That's just a disguise, isn't it?

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.070
Take it off.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.640
Wh-What was that?

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.490
You think an assassin would show their true identity?

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:07.840
No idiot would do that!

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.390
So what, I'm an idiot?

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:11.390
Jeez, you're such a pain!

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.250
I just need to accomplish my mission!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.410
Take this! Killer fist!

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:17.290
Are you done?

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.450
Don't tell me you're seriously an assassin?

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:24.690
I said that earlier!

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:27.030
But if you're going to announce that you're an assassin,

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:29.630
why did you have to disguise yourself as Yasuna?

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:33.480
Your stupidity is exactly like hers too...

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.580
Gotcha!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:37.730
Dang. I missed.

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.250
Don't tell me you're...

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:43.020
Yes, I'm here to get rid of you too.

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:46.300
I didn't think there'd be another assassin with the same idea, though.

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:47.970
How about we team up—

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.030
Now it's two versus one.

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:57.450
All right, here's the plan.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.550
First you charge in and grab her attention...

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.400
Why do I have to take the hit?

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.210
Fine. We'll both do it.

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:05.280
But if we both do it...

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:10.440
It looks like those two don't need my help.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.450
Can I leave?

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:14.910
Sonya-chan, where are you?

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:16.590
What's this?

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:17.750
Ah! The real one!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:18.790
Gotcha!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:22.340
Round 'n' round! Hurry!

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.690
Now you won't be able to tell who's the real one!

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:27.990
You stupid little...

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.800
Don't just play along with them!

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:33.330
They disguised themselves as you to get rid of me!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.450
Are you turning your back on me?

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:35.590
Seriously?

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:36.810
Seriously?

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:37.590
Seriously?

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.350
Seriously?

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:38.750
Seriously?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:39.320
Seriously?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:39.830
Seriously?

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:40.160
Seriously?

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:42.650
One of you's annoying enough...

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:45.810
All right, then. What did you eat yesterday for lunch?

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:48.590
Only the real one will know.

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:51.280
Hey!

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:56.250
You're under our spell now!

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:57.990
I'm going to kill the real one later...

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.240
Here's our chance!

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.410
Attack in unison!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:09.500
Since you don't know who the real one is,

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.490
you can't carelessly attack.

00:21:12.720 --> 00:21:14.230
Hey, wait a sec.

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:17.340
I wouldn't mind attacking the real one.

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:18.350
Please do!

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:20.040
You're not serious, right?!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:22.850
I believe in you!

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:28.570
I wonder which one was real in the end...

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:30.840
No worries.

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:31.850
Yes worries!

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:35.050
Oh, I knew the real one could take the hit.

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:47.900
I bet you knew I was the real one halfway through that, right?

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:48.780
Nope.

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:52.940
Oh come on, Sonya-chan!

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:02.300
It's you!

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:07.880
Ice Cream, Watermelon, Long Night, Assassins.

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:43.330
Pick your poison of the trade secrets.

00:23:43.330 --> 00:23:45.810
The profitable path of violence.

00:23:45.810 --> 00:23:48.310
Finding fault in insect catching and inch worms.

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:50.380
The waves dance at the mercy of the waves.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:52.870
During the days of our youth in the forest,

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:55.380
Hands of the puppet master have the scent of death.

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:57.470
In the middle of a purgatory flame,

00:23:57.470 --> 00:24:00.090
The requiem's melody is sung.

00:24:00.090 --> 00:24:02.080
Next time, on Kill Me Baby,

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:03.660
Kill number five:

00:24:03.660 --> 00:24:06.120
Bugs, Festival, Sea, Puppets.

00:24:06.120 --> 00:24:09.000
Now, what will you do, Oribe Yasuna?
